        at function node $f$ to be the mapping
        \begin{align}
            \beli_f^{(t)}: \tset{X}_{\setpf} \to \sC, \qquad
            \tvx_{\setpf}
            &\mapsto 
              \bigl( \kappa_f^{(t)} \bigr)^{\!-1}
              \cdot
              f\bigl( \tvx_{\setpf} \bigr)
              \cdot
              \prod_{e \in \setpf}
                \mu_{\ef}^{(t)}(\txe),
            \label{sec:DENFG:eqn:1}
        \end{align}
        where the scaling factor $ \kappa_f^{(t)} $ is defined to be
        %--------------------------------------------------------------------
        \begin{align*}
          \kappa_f^{(t)} \defeq
          \sum_{ \tvx_{\setpf} }
          f\bigl( \tvx_{\setpf} \bigr)
          \cdot
          \prod_{e \in \setpf}
          \mu_{\ef}^{(t)}(\txe).
        \end{align*}
        %--------------------------------------------------------------------
        The associated vector is defined to be 
        $ \vbeli_{f}^{(t)} \defeq \bigl( \beli_f^{(t)}(\tvx_{\setpf}) \bigr)_{ \!  \tvx_{\setpf} } $.

