    \item If an edge $ e = (f_{i},f_{j}) \in \setEfull $ satisfies
        $ \kappa_{\efi}^{(t)} \cdot \kappa_{\efj}^{(t)} \cdot \kappa_e^{(t)} \cdot 
        \kappa_{f_{i}}^{(t)} \cdot \kappa_{f_{j}}^{(t)}
        = 0 $, 
        then we skip the update procedures of 
        Steps~\ref{SPA: update message: DE-NFG},~\ref{SPA: update belief edges: DE-NFG}, 
        and~\ref{SPA: update belief functions: DE-NFG} 
