    If the DE-NFG $\graphN$ is tree-structured, \ie, cycle-free,
    then $\graphN$ has only one SPA fixed point and the associated SPA-fixed point message vector~$\vmu$ satisfies $\ZBSPA(\graphN,\vmu) = Z(\graphN)$. 
