	\section{Proof of Proposition~\ref{prop:DENFG:LCT:1}}
	\label{apx:LCT DENFGs}
	The proofs of Properties~\ref{prop:DENFG:LCT:1:item:1}--\ref{prop:DENFG:LCT:1:item:7} are straightforward generalizations of the
