  $ \matr{C}_{f} $ in~\eqref{sec:DENFG:eqn:6} is a PSD matrix,
  and Property~\ref{prop:DENFG:LCT:1:item:8} in Proposition~\ref{prop:DENFG:LCT:1}, \ie, $\matr{ C }_{ M_{\efi} },\matr{ C }_{ M_{\efi} } \in \setHerm{ \LCTset{X}_{e} }$,
  and where step $(d)$ again follows from the definition of $ \LCT{f} $ in~\eqref{sec:LCT:eqn:1}.

