\subsection*{Green building blocks as decarbonization capabilities}

The regression analysis of Fig.~\ref{fig:fig3} validates our GBB construct in a particularly relevant setting, asking: what types of technologies do firms invent to reduce greenhouse gas emissions? This suggests that we can interpret GBBs as  capabilities that help develop new climate-change mitigation technologies. Fig.~\ref{fig:fig4} shows that these capabilities differ substantially across countries and firms. 

