  \item \textbf{We present \method, the first open-source automatic pipeline for constructing GitHub issue resolution benchmarks across multiple languages and repositories.} Our approach automates all key stages—evaluation environment construction, grading, and fail2pass validation—to minimize manual intervention. Both code and datasets are released at \url{https://github.com/DeepSoftwareAnalytics/swe-factory}.

