\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=15pt]
  \item  Valid Rate (\%): The proportion of instances for which manual inspection confirms that the generated instance passes fail-to-pass validation. An instance is considered valid if it can be validated as passing after initially failing.
  \item Success Rate (\%): The proportion of tasks where our method successfully outputs a result.
  \item Time (min): The average time required to process each task.
