\subsection{Performance-Efficiency Pareto Front}

We further explore the Pareto Front of performance and efficiency for all hybrid models considered herein. We relate the FLOPs of the token mixers to the language modeling performance for each model and hybridization setting (averaged over all benchmarks and both model sizes). Details for the FLOP calculation are presented in Appendix \ref{sec:flop_analysis_token_mixers}.
