Nevertheless, they can be approached by means of tailored ordered formulations.
For example, the MAD can be computed by introducing a continuous variable $\gamma \geq 0$ which represents the median of the absolute deviations from the mean, i.e., $|x_i - median(x)|$, and a set of binary variables $\alpha_i$, for $i\in \{1,...,n\}$, such that,  
