\alpha_i = \begin{cases}
1, & \text{ if  }  |x_i - median(x)| > \gamma, \\
0, & \text{ if  }  |x_i - median(x)| \leq \gamma.
\end{cases}
\end{equation}
Therefore, let $\widehat{k} = \Big\lfloor \frac{n}{2} \Big\rfloor$ a formulation to compute MAD can be introduced as follows,
