    %
    %
    Next, observe that \cref{item:lipschitz_continuity_of_solutions_kernel_w_result} in \cref{lem:lipschitz_continuity_of_solutions_kernel_w} (applied with $\eta \with \eta$, $c \with c$, $L \with L$, $K \with K$, $f \with f$, $(\tker^{\pr{a}})_{a \in A} \with (\tker_2^{\pr{a}})_{a \in A}$ in the notation of \cref{lem:lipschitz_continuity_of_solutions_kernel_w}) yields for all $x, y \in \R^\dm$, $a \in A$ that
