    %
    the assumption that for all $\dm \in \N$, $\eps \in \err$ it holds that $\max \cu{ \cL\pr{\ft_{\dm, \eps}^{\pr{a}}}, \fnorm{\cD \pr{\ft_{\dm, \eps}^{\pr{a}} } }} \le \genConst \dm^\genConst \eps^{-\genConst}$,
