    Hence, it holds for all $\theta \in \Theta$, $\dm \in \N$, $\err \in \eps$ that $ \max\cu{ \cL\pr{ \ft_{\dm, \eps}^{\pr{\action}} \bullet \Xi_\dm^0\pr{ \ol{\omega} } }, \fnorm{\cD \pr{ \ft_{\dm, \eps}^{\pr{\action}} \bullet \Xi_\dm^0\pr{ \ol{\omega} } }}  } \le \genConst \dm^\genConst \eps^{-\genConst} $.
    %
    %
    Moreover, observe that the assumption that for all $\theta \in \Theta$, $\dm \in \N$ it holds that $\F_\dm^\theta = \sigma \pr{\xi_\dm^\theta}$
