The matrices $H_\Gamma$ and $H_\Delta$ are constructed to be orthogonal.  
For example, let us examine the orthogonality between the 7th row of $H_\Gamma$ and the 5th row of $H_\Delta$.  
These rows contain the following intersecting non-zero entries:
