We conducted numerical experiments over depolarizing channels with physical error rate  $p_D$. 
The proposed decoding method was implemented using Algorithm~\ref{003024_3Jun25}, and decoding success or failure was determined using the degeneracy-aware criterion described in Section~\ref{013101_9Jun25}.



