We also examine the impact of removing the auxiliary reconstruction objectives described in \autoref{sec:masking_strategy}. Training solely on intent reconstruction leads to a slight decrease in transition accuracy, indicating that multi-task reconstruction objectives could be beneficial for learning more robust features.

