Restricting to unary FDs and binary CDs, we next show that the cycle rule together with reflexivity forms an infinite sound and complete proof system. 
%Let us briefly state the necessary definitions before proving this statement. 




%\jonni{Reformulated below as $\Sigma\cup \{\phi\}$ are unary FDs and binary CDs. Every CD is trivially entailed and derived.}
