\begin{corollary}\label{cor:simple}
     Let $K$ be any positive commutative monoid.
 Now, $\Sigma \models \phi$ if and only if $\Sigma \models_{K} \phi$, for any set of unary FDs and binary CDs $\Sigma\cup\{\phi\}$. 
\end{corollary}

